Astronomical data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The star catalogue in `data/catalog/` is a DERIVED DATABASE and is NOT covered by
the Apache License. It is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. See `data/catalog/LICENSE.md`
for the full notice, and `docs/guides/catalogue.md` for how it is built.

The obligation attaches to that database, not to the software that reads it:
CC BY-SA 4.0 § 4(b) makes a database containing a substantial portion of the
licensed contents Adapted Material, explicitly excluding "its individual
contents". Apache-2.0 on the source and CC BY-SA 4.0 on the catalogue therefore
cover different works and do not conflict.

