Planetary surface maps
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`data/textures/` holds surface, elevation, cloud and ring maps for the Solar
System, built by `apps/ingest` from published imagery. **Not covered by the
Apache License.** Per-file provenance is in `data/textures/manifest.json` and the
terms are in `data/textures/LICENSE.md`.

Most are public domain — NASA and USGS imagery is not subject to copyright:

  NASA Earth Observatory — Blue Marble Next Generation, Black Marble, GEBCO_08
  NASA Scientific Visualization Studio — LRO LROC colour, LRO LOLA topography
  NASA / JPL / USGS Astrogeology Science Center — Voyager and Galileo global
    mosaics of Io, Europa, Ganymede and Callisto

The exceptions require attribution and impose no share-alike:

  Solar System Scope — https://www.solarsystemscope.com/textures/
  Maps of Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune and Saturn's
  rings. Licensed CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Modified: resized and re-encoded.

Gaia (ESA) is deliberately NOT used. Its data are distributed under
CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO, and a non-commercial clause on the data this game cannot run
without would attach that restriction to the shipped artifact. See
docs/spikes.md § 4.
